### =========================
### 🔐 AUTH FLOW
### =========================

### Register USER
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "User Test",
  "email": "user@test.com",
  "password": "1234",
  "role": "USER"
}

###

### Register TRAINER
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Trainer Test",
  "email": "trainer@test.com",
  "password": "1234",
  "role": "TRAINER"
}

###

### Login USER
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@test.com",
  "password": "1234"
}

###

### Login TRAINER
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "trainer@test.com",
  "password": "1234"
}

###

