### =========================
### 🧪 SECURITY TESTS
### =========================

### ❌ FĂRĂ TOKEN (trebuie 403)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/workouts

###

### 🔐 USER TOKEN (GET allowed)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/workouts
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

###

### 🔐 TRAINER TOKEN
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/workouts
Authorization: Bearer {{trainer_token}}

### =========================
### 💪 WORKOUTS
### =========================

### ➕ CREATE WORKOUT (TRAINER ONLY)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/workouts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{trainer_token}}

{
  "name": "Push Day",
  "description": "Chest + Triceps",
  "trainerId": 2
}

###

### 📥 GET ALL WORKOUTS
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/workouts
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

### =========================
### 🧍 USER WORKOUTS
### =========================

### ➕ ASSIGN WORKOUT TO USER
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/user-workouts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

{
  "userId": 1,
  "workoutId": 1,
  "date": "2026-04-01"
}

###

### 📥 GET USER WORKOUTS
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/user-workouts
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

### =========================
### 🏋️ TRAINERS
### =========================

POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/trainers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{trainer_token}}

{
  "name": "Should Fail If Not Admin"
}

###

GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/trainers
Authorization: Bearer {{trainer_token}}